          "text": "Visual symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Gradual onset about 3 weeks ago of intermittent blurred vision, worse in the left eye than the right and worse at the end of the day; feels like straining the left eye. Right eye is 'ok maybe not as sharp as before.' More noticeable when reading stories at work, looking at the smartboard from the back of the room, watching TV, and reading medication labels. Still driving but reports decreased confidence, especially at night, with signs appearing somewhat fuzzy."
      }
